  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p><span style='line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;'><font color='#000000'>An effective\nrecycling program can divert 30-40 percent of a household’s waste from\nlandfills. To help residents maximize waste diversion and minimize their\nenvironmental impact, the City of Fredericton offers two recycling programs—a\ncurbside pickup program for houses, and three recycling depots for residents of\ncondominiums and apartments with more than four units.</font></span></p><p><span style='line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;'><font color='#000000'><span style='line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: FR-CA; mso-fareast-language: EN-CA; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;'>Un programme efficace\nde recyclage peut éviter l’enfouissement de 30 à 40 % des déchets\nménagers. Pour aider les résidents à maximiser le réacheminement de leurs\ndéchets et ainsi minimiser leur impact environnemental, la Ville de Fredericton\noffre deux programmes de recyclage : la collecte en bordure de rue pour\nles maisons et trois points de recyclage pour les immeubles de plus de quatre\nlogements (condos et appartements).</span></font></span></p>"
